From 1e78bebb7295ff1237d57faf18ab35940c017a4e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ObeseCatLord <6099645+ObeseCatLord@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 11:07:26 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] ga2: hor+ support, texture packs and dumps

- ga2_activity: shared 3D-scene test and the hor+ factor set by game
  hooks; the presentation stretches hor+ 3D frames over the wide area and
  the mouse maps through the squeezed 2D space.
- gs_texpacks: textures identified by a hash of their decoded RGBA from the
  CPU copy of GS memory; GA2_TEXTURE_PACKS folders of <hash>.png replace
  them at any resolution (images kept alive, GENERAL layout as paraLLEl-GS
  expects); GA2_TEX_DUMP writes every sampled texture; packs can be
  switched at run time.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
